# 2026-08-17 — page 2 of this PDF carries the author's student ID in its title
# block. The repository history was rewritten with git-filter-repo before first
# publication specifically to strip that ID from every commit tree; publishing
# this file would have put it straight back. THIS ENTRY IS A PRIVACY CONTROL,
# not tidying — do not remove it without redacting and re-exporting first.
docs/FDR_v3.pdf

# 2026-08-17 — the working record: one spec per investigation and nineteen
# adversarial reviews, 70 files. Supersedes the earlier superpowers/plans/
# entry, which this covers. Cited ~144 times from 50 files that remain, in both
# READMEs, FDR_v3.md and several source comments; those citations are left
# standing as the record of what was investigated and when. The cost, stated in
# docs/README.md: a claim of the form "measured in spec X" can no longer be
# followed to spec X. docs/receipts/ and docs/CORRECTIONS.md are what a reader
# can still check.
docs/superpowers/
